# Security headers for every prerendered page and file, which the asset layer serves without the Worker. The live
# routes (middleware.ts, SITE_HEADERS) send the same set; a test keeps them the same.
# Decision: docs/adr/0092-security-headers-from-the-asset-layer-too.md.
/*
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
